# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  UniversalPOS — .gitignore
#  Controls what goes to GitHub and what stays local only.
#  Rules at the top of this file take priority.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── README strategy ────────────────────────────────────
# README.md         → goes to GitHub (the short public version)
# README-personal.md → stays LOCAL ONLY (your full working doc)
README-personal.md
token.txt
README.md

# ── Architecture docs ──────────────────────────────────
# Keep PROJECT.md local — it has internal implementation
# details you may not want public. Remove this line if
# you want to share it on GitHub.
PROJECT.md

# ── Application secrets — CRITICAL: NEVER push these ──
# These files contain your DB password, email password,
# and JWT secret key. One push = everyone can see them.
pos-api/src/main/resources/application.yml
pos-api/src/main/resources/application-local.yml

# ── Maven build output ─────────────────────────────────
# "target/" is where Maven puts compiled .class files and
# JARs. These are generated — never commit them.
# They can be rebuilt from source at any time with mvn build.
target/
*.class
*.jar

# ── IDE / editor files ─────────────────────────────────
# These are personal editor settings — they differ per
# developer and don't belong in the repo.
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
.vscode/

# ── Logs ───────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ── Generated PDF receipts ─────────────────────────────
# PDFs are generated at runtime — no need to track them.
receipts/

# ── OS system files ────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  WHAT DOES GO TO GITHUB:
#  ✅ README.md (your public GitHub README)
#  ✅ All Java source code (src/)
#  ✅ pom.xml files (build config)
#  ✅ Flyway migrations (db/migration/*.sql)
#  ✅ Email templates (templates/)
#  ✅ docker/docker-compose.yml
#  ✅ .gitignore (this file)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
README.md
